      Drive      - hooks AutoDrive AI, full-throttle max speed
      Blatant TP - drives normally until MinTime-3s, then warps to finish
    Features:
      - F4 keybind toggles the menu
      - Side-screen open button when menu is closed
      - Gauge: Level, XP, best times, MinTime countdown, run timer
      - Full Unload button in Settings
]]

